{
  "id": "illness-anxiety-disorder",
  "term": "illness anxiety disorder",
  "definition": "Illness anxiety disorder is a mental health condition marked by persistent, excessive fear of having or developing a serious illness, even when physical symptoms are absent or only mild. It involves strong health-related worry for at least six months and often includes repeated checking or reassurance-seeking, or avoidance of medical settings.",
